{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Lupin the Third Part 3","Lupin III chronicles the adventures of Arsene Lupin III, the world's greatest thief, and his partners in crime: master marksman Daisuke Jigen, beautiful and scheming Fujiko Mine and stoic samurai Goemon Ishikawa XIII. Lupin and his gang travel around the globe in search of the world's greatest treasures and riches and always keeping one step ahead of the tireless Inspector Zenigata, who has vowed to bring Lupin to justice. \n\n\n(Source: AnimeNewsNetwork)"],"ja":["ルパン三世 - Part III",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":1425,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":27947,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-1426","ids":{"shikimori":1426,"mal":1426,"anilist":1426,"kodik":"serial-25392"},"kodikIds":["serial-25391","serial-25392"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-25391":"2020-05-04T11:26:11Z","serial-25392":"2020-05-04T11:55:12Z"},"title":"Люпен III: Часть III","originalTitle":"Rupan Sansei: Part III","alt":"Lupin III: Part III / Lupin The Third: Part 3 / Lupin Sansei: Part III / Lupin III TV 3 Lupin the Third Part 3 ルパン三世 - Part III","description":"Мы вновь становимся свидетелями похождений Арсена Люпена Третьего — обаятельного и изобретательного вора, способного выбраться из любой переделки с трофеем в руках. Вместе со своими компаньонами, а также с неутомимым инспектором Дзэнигатой на хвосте, Люпен, переодевшись в розовый пиджак, вновь бросает вызов всем богачам мира, доказывая, что нет на свете такого сокровища, которое он не смог бы украсть.","year":1984,"type":"TV","genres":["сэйнэн","Экшен","Приключения","Комедия","взрослые персонажи"],"rating":7.35,"popularity":8489,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[1425,27947],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/1426/9df2a2569a709693d8b3ac6438258b77.jpeg","width":600,"height":900},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1426-11KpXpbcFlU0.jpg","width":1900,"height":400}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9